---
<Base title="How we check" description="What Verified, Info from online and Unverified mean on Find Me CBR.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>How we check</h1>
    <p>Every place shows the date we last checked it, and a tag for how well we've checked it:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Verified:</strong> we confirmed it with the business or in person.</li>
      <li><strong>Info from online:</strong> taken from the business's own website, socials or other public sources. We haven't confirmed it with them yet.</li>
      <li><strong>Unverified:</strong> we haven't checked it yet. We never guess.</li>
      <li><strong>Our take:</strong> our opinion, clearly marked. It's never paid for, and we don't give opinions on health services.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>A service, such as a cleaner or electrician, only appears for a suburb they've told us they cover. Where they're based doesn't count.</p>
    <p>Sponsored places are labelled, appear at most once in the first five results, and still have to match everything you searched for.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="rowtile" href="/report/"><span><Icon name="flag" class="lead" /><span>Spotted something wrong?<small>Tell us and we'll check it</small></span></span><Icon name="chevron-right" /></a>
</Base>
